            "block_content": "[V2G20-1747] After receiving the supportedAppProtocolRes with \"ResponseCode = OK_SuccessfulNegotiation\", the EVCC shall send a SessionSetupReq within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 215.",
