        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1089] The SECC shall not send ResponseCode set to OK_SuccessfulNegotiationWithMinorDeviation in supportedAppProtocolRes, since deviations are not supported by ISO 15118-20 (this document).",
